          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s01_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c4_authors_benchmark_nine_existing_robu",
          "text": "Using it, the authors benchmark nine existing robust RL algorithms across four environments and show that their certificates are often tight.",
          "expected_role": "result",
          "cue_keywords": [
