    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "motivation",
      "heading": "Motivation",
      "chunks": [
        {
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "chunk_id": "s03_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c1_core_motivation_trust_you_cannot",
          "text": "The core motivation is trust. If you cannot prove a policy is robust, then passing today's attacks tells you little about tomorrow's.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "core",
            "motivation",
            "trust",
            "you",
            "cannot",
            "prove",
            "policy",
            "robust",
            "passing",
            "today"
          ],
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s03_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c2_randomized_smoothing_become_leading",
          "text": "Randomized smoothing has become a leading tool for certifying image classifiers, but reinforcement learning does not fit its mold.",
          "expected_role": "result",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "randomized",
            "smoothing",
            "become",
            "leading",
            "tool",
            "certifying",
            "image",
            "classifiers",
            "but",
            "reinforcement"
          ],
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s03_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c3_classification_confidence_output_liv",
          "text": "In classification the confidence output lives in a known zero-to-one range and behaves like a probability; in Q-learning the value function has an unknown range and its outputs are not probabilities at all.",
          "expected_role": "result",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "classification",
            "confidence",
            "output",
            "lives",
            "known",
            "zero-to-one",
            "range",
            "behaves",
            "like",
            "probability"
          ],
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s03_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c4_top_single_action_decision_not",
          "text": "On top of that, a single action decision is not the whole story: what ultimately matters is the reward accumulated along an entire trajectory of decisions. CROP is designed to overcome both obstacles.",
          "expected_role": "figure",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "top",
            "single",
            "action",
            "decision",
            "not",
            "whole",
            "story",
            "what",
            "ultimately",
            "matters"
