          "chunk_id": "s04_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c4_third_authors_apply_these_tools",
          "text": "Third, the authors apply these tools to nine existing robust RL algorithms across four environments, and release the results as an open leaderboard for the community.",
          "expected_role": "result",
          "cue_keywords": [
